# --- Card artwork: copyrighted, large, and regenerable -------------------
# The Mechanics Lab corpus is defined by its TXT + CSV, which ARE versioned.
# The 275 card images (~291 MB) are Wizards of the Coast artwork delivered by
# a Deck Builder export at runtime; git would keep every byte forever.
# Any real_cards folder, at any depth. The earlier rule was anchored
# to one path, and a second test deck arrived as
# "Test Deck/Testing Deck/real_cards/" -- 390 images the rule did not
# match. Artwork must never be committed (GIT-001), so the rule is
# now about the NAME rather than one location.
**/real_cards/

# Spike archive (~13 MB, mostly bundled card PNGs). The spike's source is
# small and can be committed separately if we decide to keep it in-tree.
*.zip

# --- Build output --------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
target/
.gradle/
*.class
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Local environment ---------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
*.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Phase 0A spike ------------------------------------------------------
# Upstream Forge checkouts are ~1 GB and belong to upstream, not to us.
# The PIN (commit hash) is recorded in docs/research/phase-00a/, which IS
# versioned. The checkout itself is reproducible from that hash.
spikes/*/forge-upstream/
third_party/forge/

# Spike run logs
spikes/**/*.log

# --- Phase 1 build output ---------------------------------------------
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
.gradle/
build/
*/build/
data/
